{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "770a34e1a0a824719662d282fdb7724414eaae14eead22c894e01c025697ef7f", "ja": "（いよいよ、美也の初ステージが始まる。\n会場に漂う、張り詰めた空気……美也は大丈夫か？）", "zh": "（美也的首场表演终于要开始了。\n会场弥漫着紧张的气氛……不知道美也有没有问题？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "83280447bcf6b1c5e182343ee990e5b628fa6034aab7bee1ba6021380d3be53e", "ja": "お～、{$P$}さんですか～。\nお疲れさまです～。今、お茶を淹れますね～。", "zh": "哦～原来是{$P$}先生～\n辛苦了～我现在帮你泡茶哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a92fa03e639f57338cf2bd822e2a592eab97e3e996b7addc4df52998e3b95ed3", "ja": "あ、ああ。\nえっと……ありがとう……。", "zh": "好、好喔。\n呃……谢谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "1825877081ab0922ba172f697d5685b0a45754e3019ee359bb114b71ebac243b", "ja": "お～、見てください～。茶柱が立っていますよ～。\n今日はいいことがありそうですな～。", "zh": "哦～请看～茶梗立起来了～\n看来今天会有好事哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "e634a610237d94a1e1daff47bfb6eabd143069237f38d2478348b16c6a00a301", "ja": "え～と、お菓子は……。", "zh": "我看看～点心在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "960077a4179b1ae5fd81a880ff18dc22b33c3ce11f7c3515b133adcbfea57085", "ja": "み、美也、お茶だけで充分だよ。", "zh": "美、美也，我喝茶就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "d70ae949abe0bafcba0103d3e361bbc9097bf9db436bb4a5c4f06f45101ceafd", "ja": "そうですか～。\nでは、ゆっくりしていってくださいね～。むふふ。", "zh": "这样啊～\n那么，就请你慢慢享用吧～呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1007_p", "source_sha256": "07e1c4cf03a8ba2e87071791354c8c3d3b5bab29df0f92f37f25b514e81f71b4", "ja": "あ、ありがとう。でも本番前だから、\nゆっくりもしてられないんだけど……。", "zh": "谢、谢谢你。不过正式表演就快开始了，\n我实在慢不下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "ce63c7224c532a24f46fb0fdd141fd320a480b501a9e58eb25b6f75b5d8e5463", "ja": "ふむふむ……確かに、それもそうですな～。", "zh": "嗯嗯……的确，这么说也是呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1009_p", "source_sha256": "71364731e06a49f73420b65c301d50edf404ae50b67048f3174717262204bcea", "ja": "はは、美也はいつも通りだな。\n調子はどうだ？", "zh": "哈哈，美也，你还是一如往常呢。\n状况如何啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "31f2bc9a5ec32b0cd1e6137d6cabb01bb142ed16e3321dd9ed07da63a450cdd0", "ja": "絶好調ですよ～。\nごはんもたくさん食べましたし～。", "zh": "状况绝佳哦～\n也吃了很多饭哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a2603f40389371e81e2b5f55ad07d686c858e0c817060837bf836dc8e0ce07f7", "ja": "よかった。本番前だから心配してたんだけど、\n問題なさそうだな。", "zh": "太好了。我还担心正式开始前会出事，\n看来是没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "fb678bed8e084a4def107bb65785702c7debf9cab18559283594a7e02ad2ec73", "ja": "問題ありますよ～？\n今も緊張して、すごくドキドキしています～。", "zh": "有问题哦～\n我现在很紧张，心脏跳得非常快～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0488126e0c1037b1768e830c7f461685b16090fc09d83888e5bb5d99fbd198df", "ja": "えっ……そ、そうなのか？", "zh": "咦……是、是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "4fe378c367302bd679bb6a0a32a4048fa560b28dbed485f4be3ec441bdf5dfdb", "ja": "はい～。でも、それよりも……練習した歌やダンスを、\n早くみんなに見てもらいたいんです～。", "zh": "是的～不过，虽然紧张……\n但我更想快点让大家欣赏我练习的歌曲和舞蹈～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "e35af67067fc07f67a61bcf9f454021da7920cb320c5bbee29b5a085f3648ec4", "ja": "ドキドキするけど、ワクワクもして～……。\nあっ、今は、ウズウズが一番みたいです～。", "zh": "我觉得很紧张，但同时也很期待……\n啊，现在最多的好像是跃跃欲试～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1016_p", "source_sha256": "103967d07181010c9e2ac3c335f437b58d1cc15ec5840dbf2b3f754fa180359f", "ja": "（早くステージに立ちたいってことか……。\nはは、期待できそうだ）", "zh": "（所以她想要赶快登上舞台是吗……\n哈哈，真令人期待啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1b9f93bc933379b290f0c148159aa9e060a34de364f823aae0bcdffac84ce45a", "ja": "俺も緊張してたけど、美也のおかげで、\nいい意味でリラックスできたよ。ありがとうな。", "zh": "美也，我本来也很紧张，但是听你说完后，\n我心情轻松多了，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "e67c75a9c2f8dc6b9ccde82628d39783c86f805e13117f8b3bc8df1a867657c6", "ja": "いいえ～。私も{$P$}さんとお話し\nできて、ますますウズウズしてきました～。", "zh": "不会～我也是，跟{$P$}先生讲了话，\n现在越来越迫不及待了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "b66917b201d339871719a380294ba94e9af3d620388312fe0ab30994beb2ff32", "ja": "それでは、ちょうど時間ですし、行きましょうか～。\n私の初めてのステージ、見ていてくださいね～。", "zh": "那么，正好时间也差不多了，我们出发吧～\n请看好我的首次登台哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
