{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_003_1021_p", "source_sha256": "ae3eaaf28433868d3180fb5ea77986eca3b83aebced40bc2b98c24215c5bf7f0", "ja": "（美也の初めての晴れ舞台。その姿は、\nファンのみんなの目に焼き付くに違いない……！）", "zh": "（美也首次登上大舞台。\n她一定会在粉丝心中留下深刻的印象……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
